ory follows Welkin, the son of a former war hero; Isara, Welkin's Darcsen adoptive sister; and Alicia, a member of the Bruhl town watch, as they fight the Imperials in the ragtag Gallian militia group, Squad 7.\n\nSquad 7 fights to regain their homes and livelihoods with Welkin as the squad leader and commander of the Edelweiss tank; Alicia as a scout; Isara as the pilot of the Edelweiss, and a variety of colorful individuals."},"tags":[{"name":"Military","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"War","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Guns","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Alternate Universe","rank":50,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Politics","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Power","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tanks","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Steampunk","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Valkyria Chronicles","english":"Valkyria Chronicles","native":"戦場のヴァルキュリア","romaji":"Senjou no Valkyria","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"战场女武神"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"战场上的女武神"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"战场挖个雷"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}